<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">World2Act: Latent Action Post-Training via Skill-Compositional World Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">An Dinh Vuong
